flowchart TB
    Start([User opens app]) --> Auth{Authenticated?}
    Auth -->|no| Login[Login screen]
    Login --> SSO[SSO redirect]
    SSO --> Auth
    Auth -->|yes| Home[Home dashboard]
    Home --> Pick{Pick action}
    Pick -->|create| New[New document wizard]
    Pick -->|browse| List[Document list]
    Pick -->|search| Q[Search bar]
    New --> Save[(Saved to DB)]
    List --> Open[Open document]
    Q --> Results[Search results]
    Results --> Open
    Open --> Edit[Edit + autosave]
    Edit --> Save

    style Save fill:#cfe8cf,stroke:#2e7d32
    style Login fill:#ffe0b2,stroke:#ef6c00
